  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rainwater Harvesting in White Nile, South Kordofan, Sinnar and Darfur States Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The  main  objective  of  the  project  is  to  improve  the  living  conditions  of  the  Internally Displaced  Persons  (IDP)  in  the  region  of  White  Nile,  South  Kordofan,  Sinnar  and  Darfur States by securing water for human and their livestock consumption and promote sustainable peace  among  farmers  and  nomads</narrative>
  </description>
